\begin_layout Title
Code to compute 
\begin_inset Formula $\ell_{P}$
\end_inset

 and detect K-unstability
\end_layout

\begin_layout Standard
Let 
\begin_inset Formula $P\subset\mathbb{R}^{n}$
\end_inset

 be a lattice polytope which is defined by 
\begin_inset Formula 
\[
P=\left\{ x\in\mathbb{R}^{n}\mid\left\langle x,v_{i}\right\rangle +a_{i}\ge0,\ \forall1\le i\le I\right\} ,
\]

\end_inset

where 
\begin_inset Formula $v_{i}\in\mathbb{Z}^{n}$
\end_inset

 are primitive vectors and 
\begin_inset Formula $a_{i}\in\mathbb{Z}$
\end_inset

.
 Let 
\begin_inset Formula $\mathrm{d}\sigma$
\end_inset

 be the lattice measure on the boundary 
\begin_inset Formula $\partial P$
\end_inset

,
 which is defined as follows.
 Consider a facet of 
\begin_inset Formula $P$
\end_inset

 
\begin_inset Formula 
\[
F_{i}=\left\{ x\in P\mid\left\langle x,v_{i}\right\rangle +a_{i}=0\right\} .
\]

\end_inset

Define 
\begin_inset Formula 
\[
\mathrm{d}\sigma|_{F_{i}}=\frac{\mathrm{d}s}{\left|v_{i}\right|}
\]

\end_inset

where 
\begin_inset Formula $\mathrm{d}s$
\end_inset

 is the Euclidean surface measure on 
\begin_inset Formula $F_{i}$
\end_inset

,
 and 
\begin_inset Formula $\left|v_{i}\right|$
\end_inset

 is the Euclidean 
\begin_inset Formula $2$
\end_inset

-norm.
 Another way to define 
\begin_inset Formula $\mathrm{d}\sigma$
\end_inset

:
 it is the Lebesgue measure on the affine space spanned by 
\begin_inset Formula $F_{i}$
\end_inset

 which is normalized by the rank 
\begin_inset Formula $n-1$
\end_inset

 lattice 
\begin_inset Formula $F_{i}\cap\mathbb{Z}^{n}$
\end_inset

.
 
\end_layout

\begin_layout Standard
The relative DF invariant is 
\begin_inset Formula 
\[
M_{\ell}(f)\coloneqq\int_{\partial P}f\mathrm{d}\sigma-\int_{P}f\ell_{P}\mathrm{d}x,\ \text{for convex }f:P\rightarrow\mathbb{R},
\]

\end_inset

where 
\begin_inset Formula $\ell_{P}$
\end_inset

 is the unique affine function such that 
\begin_inset Formula 
\[
M_{\ell}(h)=\int_{\partial P}h\mathrm{d}\sigma-\int_{P}h\ell_{P}\mathrm{d}x=0,\ \text{for all affine function }h.
\]

\end_inset

Equivalently,
 take 
\begin_inset Formula $h=1,x_{i}$
\end_inset

,
 
\begin_inset Formula $\ell_{P}$
\end_inset

 satisfies linear system:
 
\begin_inset Formula 
\[
\int_{P}\ell_{P}=\left|\partial P\right|_{\mathrm{d}\sigma},\int_{P}x_{i}\ell_{P}=\int_{\partial P}x_{i}\mathrm{d}\sigma,\ i=1,\dots,n.
\]

\end_inset


\end_layout

\begin_layout Definition
We say 
\begin_inset Formula $P$
\end_inset

 is relatively K-semistable if 
\begin_inset Formula $M_{\ell}(f)\geq0$
\end_inset

 for all 
\begin_inset Formula $f\in\mathcal{C}(P)$
\end_inset

,
 where 
\begin_inset Formula $\mathcal{C}(P)$
\end_inset

 is the space of continuous functions on 
\begin_inset Formula $P$
\end_inset

.
 Otherwise,
 if 
\begin_inset Formula $M_{\ell}(f)<0$
\end_inset

 for some 
\begin_inset Formula $f\in\mathcal{C}(P)$
\end_inset

,
 we say 
\begin_inset Formula $P$
\end_inset

 is relatively K-unstable.
 
\end_layout

\begin_layout Fact
\begin_inset Argument 1
status open

\begin_layout Plain Layout
Donaldson
\end_layout

\end_inset

 when 
\begin_inset Formula $n=2$
\end_inset

,
 
\begin_inset Formula $P$
\end_inset

 is relatively K-unstable if and only if there is a simple convex function of the form 
\begin_inset Formula 
\[
g=\max\left\{ ax+by+c,0\right\} 
\]

\end_inset

such that 
\begin_inset Formula $M_{\ell}(g)<0$
\end_inset

.
\end_layout

\begin_layout Standard
Goal:
 
\end_layout

\begin_layout Standard
1.
 compute 
\begin_inset Formula $\ell_{P}$
\end_inset

 precisely.
 
\end_layout

\begin_layout Standard
2.
 develop an algorithm to test the un-stability of polygons using the fact of Donaldson.
 
\end_layout

\begin_layout Standard
1.
 精确计算 
\begin_inset Formula $\ell_{P}$
\end_inset

—
—
唯一的仿射函数，
使所有仿射 
\begin_inset Formula $h$
\end_inset

 满足 
\begin_inset Formula $\int_{\partial P}h,\mathrm{d}\sigma=\int_{P}h\ell_{P},\mathrm{d}x$
\end_inset

（
\begin_inset Formula $\mathrm{d}\sigma$
\end_inset

 是边界格点测度 
\begin_inset Formula $\mathrm{d}s/|v_{i}|$
\end_inset

）。
这归结为精确求解一个 3×3 有理线性系统，
需要 
\begin_inset Formula $P$
\end_inset

 的二阶矩和边界一阶矩，
全部对格点多边形是有理数，
可以用 CGAL::Gmpq 精确完成。
与现有代码的离散 
\begin_inset Formula $\ell_{A}$
\end_inset

（
\begin_inset Formula $\fint_{Q}h=\sum_{u\in A}h(u)\ell_{A}(u)$
\end_inset

）不同，
是全新计算路径。

\end_layout

\begin_layout Standard
2.
 用 Donaldson 事实检测 K-不稳定性：
$P$ 相对 K-不稳定 ⟺ 存在简单凸函数 
\begin_inset Formula $g=\max{ax+by+c,0}$
\end_inset

 使 
\begin_inset Formula $M_{\ell}(g)=\int_{\partial P}g,\mathrm{d}\sigma-\int_{P}g\ell_{P},\mathrm{d}x<0$
\end_inset

。
算法思路：
数值扫描折痕线方向 
\begin_inset Formula $\theta$
\end_inset

 + 偏移 
\begin_inset Formula $t$
\end_inset

（固定方向时 $M_
\backslash
ell$ 是关于 $t$ 的分段三次函数），
找到负值候选后用有理数直线逼近并全程 Gmpq 精确验证 $M_
\backslash
ell(g)<0$，
给出严格 witness。
关键观察：
边界测度在每条边上的积分只依赖格点长度 $g=
\backslash
gcd(|dx|,|dy|)$，
有理直线截出的子多边形二阶矩仍是有理数，
因此精确验证可行。

\end_layout

